#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:5
msgid "Create conductor"
msgstr "创建导线"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:8
msgid "Manual conductor creation"
msgstr "手动导师创建"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:10
msgid "To create a `conductor`_ manually:"
msgstr "手动创建 `导体 <conductor_>`_ :"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:12
#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:41
msgid ""
"Select `auto numbering pattern`_ at the `Auto numbering selection panel`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 `自动编号模式 <auto numbering pattern_>`_ 现场 `自动编号选择面板 <Auto numbering "
"selection panel_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:17
#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:46
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Auto numbering selection panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 自动编号选择面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:21
#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:50
msgid ""
"If the `Auto numbering selection panel`_ is not displayed, it can be "
"displayed from **Settings > Display > Auto numbering selection**."
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `自动编号选择面板 <Auto numbering selection panel_>`_，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 自动编号选择**"
" 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:24
msgid "Click on the initial `terminal`_ from the `conductor`_."
msgstr "点击首字母 `端子 <terminal_>`_ 从 `导体 <conductor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:25
msgid ""
"Without releasing, move the mouse up to the end `terminal`_ of the "
"`conductor`_."
msgstr "不释放，将鼠标移动到尾端 `端子 <terminal_>`_ 会议日程和议程 `导体 <conductor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:26
msgid ""
"Once the end `terminal`_ is automatically identified by QElectroTech, "
"release the mouse to create the `conductor`_."
msgstr "一旦端 `端子 <terminal_>`_ 由QElectroTech自动识别，释放鼠标以创建 `导体 <conductor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:31
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech manual conductor creation"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 手动导电器创建"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:34
msgid "Automatic conductor creation"
msgstr "自动创建导体"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:36
msgid ""
"To increase the working efficiency, QElectroTech can create `conductors`_ "
"automatically when an `element`_ is added to the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"为了提高工作效率，QElectroTech可以创建 `导体 <conductors_>`_ 当一个 `元件 <element_>`_ 添加到 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:39
msgid "To create a `conductor`_ automatically:"
msgstr "要自动创建 `导体 <conductor_>`_ :"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:53
msgid "Select the icon |autoconnect| from `toolbar`_, if it is not selected."
msgstr "如果未选中，请从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |autoconnect| 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:61
msgid "autoconnect"
msgstr "自动连接"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:54
msgid ""
"`Add element`_ to `workspace`_ taking care of the `element`_ position, the "
"initial `terminal`_ and the end `terminal`_ have to be at the same vertical "
"or horizontal line."
msgstr ""
"`添加元素 <Add element_>`_ 至 `工作区 <workspace_>`_，注意 `元件 <element_>`_ 位置，初始 `端子 "
"<terminal_>`_ 和结尾 `端子 <terminal_>`_ 必须位于相同的垂直或水平线。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:59
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech automatic conductor creation"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech自动导电器创建"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:65
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:69
msgid ""
"At the case that the initial and end `terminal`_ are different potentials, "
"QElectroTech considers two `terminals`_ from the same `element`_ as "
"different potentials, QElectroTech will inform by a warning PopUP window. "
"Nevertheless, QElectroTech will create the `conductor`_"
msgstr ""
"在最初和结束的情况下 `端子 <terminal_>`_ 是不同的潜力，QEElectroTech认为两个 `终端 <terminals_>`_ 从同 "
"`元件 <element_>`_ 作为不同的潜力，QElectroTech 将通过警告的 PopUP 窗口进行通报。 尽管如此，QEctroTech "
"将创建 `导体 <conductor_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_creation.rst:76
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech different potentials warning"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 不同潜力警告"
